<mxCell id="why" value="&lt;b&gt;A message dies when…&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;rejected — nack / reject, requeue: false&lt;br&gt;expired — TTL ran out, nobody read it&lt;br&gt;maxlen — queue over x-max-length&lt;br&gt;delivery_limit — quorum delivery-limit&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;requeue: true never dead-letters&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d0d0d0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="250" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
